{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>NextDue 是一款帳單與訂閱管理工具，讓你把信用卡、租金、水電、保險及各類週期性付款集中記錄，並在到期前收到提醒，避免漏繳。此 App 特別適合需要同時處理多項帳單的租屋族、家庭用戶與自由工作者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>掃描帳單智能提醒</h2>\n<p>NextDue 讓你掃描紙本帳單或手動輸入，並透過智能到期日追蹤，一眼看清即將到期款項。你可為信用卡、租金、水電、保險及訂閱服務設定週期帳單，配合智能提醒與主畫面小工具，在到期前收到通知，避免逾期罰款。付款後可標記為已付，資料只存放於裝置，無需註冊帳戶，離線亦可使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-240-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-241-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-242-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-243-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-244-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-245-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：NextDue: Bill Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T23:19:46.740004+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}